TRAINING AND EVALUATION DATA
----------------------------
CadenceVAD models are trained on:

- LibriSpeech, Vassil Panayotov et al., CC BY 4.0. https://www.openslr.org/12/
- MUSAN, David Snyder, Guoguo Chen, Daniel Povey, CC BY 4.0.
  https://www.openslr.org/17/
- Room impulse responses and isotropic noises (OpenSLR 28), CC BY 4.0.
  https://www.openslr.org/28/

Frame targets are produced by an ensemble of Silero VAD (MIT) and FireRedVAD
(Apache-2.0). Neither model's code nor weights are included here.

AVA-Speech annotations are Copyright Google LLC, CC BY 4.0.
https://research.google.com/ava/
Audio is obtained from a third-party Apache-2.0 mirror and is not redistributed.

TEN VAD and FireRedVAD are used only as reference measurements; their source
code and weights are not included.
